# RentalERP – Electrical Equipment Rental Management System

RentalERP is a full-stack web application designed to streamline the rental operations of electrical equipment businesses. The system helps manage customers, inventory, rentals, returns, invoices, payments, and reports through a modern, user-friendly interface.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 Secure User Authentication
- 👥 Customer Management
- 📦 Equipment & Inventory Management
- 📑 Rental Order Management
- 🔄 Return Processing
- 💳 Payment Tracking
- 🧾 Invoice Generation
- 📊 Dashboard with Business Statistics
- 📄 PDF Report Generation
- 📈 Excel Export Support
- 🔍 Search & Filtering
- 📱 Responsive User Interface

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React
- Vite
- JavaScript
- CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js

### Database
- SQLite (Better SQLite3)

### Authentication
- JSON Web Token (JWT)
- bcryptjs Password Hashing

### Other Libraries
- Express
- Multer
- PDFKit
- ExcelJS
- Joi Validation
- Helmet
- Morgan
- CORS

