## 📁 Project Structure

```
RentalERP
│
├── client/          # React Frontend
├── server/          # Express Backend
├── package.json
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚙️ Installation

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/RentalERP.git

cd RentalERP
```

### 2. Install Dependencies

```bash
npm run install:all
```

or install manually

```bash
npm install

cd server
npm install

cd ../client
npm install
```

---

## ▶️ Run the Project

From the project root:

```bash
npm run dev
```

This starts both:

- Express Backend
- React Frontend

---

## Build Frontend

```bash
npm run build
```

---

## API Health Check

```
GET /

Response

{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Server is running"
}
```

